{title: Leave Her, Johnny}
{artist: Traditional Sea Shanty}
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 105}

{comment: Strophe 1}
[D]Oh the times were hard and the [G]wages [D]low
[A]Leave her, Johnny, [D]leave her
And the [G]grub was [D]bad and the [G]gales did [D]blow
And it's [D]time for [A]us to [D]leave her

{comment: Refrain}
